    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kennedy Estate Agents present this detached family home with the benefit of a self-contained annex attached to the property. This spacious home extends to approximately 254 sq. metres in total. \r\nThe internal layout offers great flexibility with living space aplenty and the annex being the ideal space for au-pairs, multi-generational living or even as a rental unit. \r\nThe property was constructed in the early 1970's and sits on a level site of approx. 0.4 acres. On approach, you are greeted by a boundary walled entrance leading to the driveway and mature gardens. \r\nThis family home offers country living at its best while at the same time being less than 10 minutes' drive from the busy town of Midleton. \r\nMidleton benefits from a lively atmosphere and a thriving community, which is evident in the popular Farmer's Market, taking place every Saturday morning. The Town offers a choice of cafes, shops, bars, restaurants and a selection of schools both National & Secondary, such as the highly regarded Midleton College. \r\nCloser to home, the Midleton-Youghal Greenway which passes through nearby Mogeely Village (1km away), offers a safe 23 kilometre cycle and walking trail. Mogeely is home to a playground, church, bar and a fast-food option. Castlemartyr Village (1.5 km in the other direction), offers a national school, choice of shops, pubs, and the well-known Village Greengrocer. \r\nThere are a choice of beaches within close proximity such as Garryvoe, Ardnahinch and Ballinwilling. \r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\nEntrance Hallway:\r\nCarpet flooring. \r\nGuest Toilet: \r\nWC, wash hand basin and tiled flooring. \r\nSitting Room:\r\nGenerous room with corner window, triple aspect, open fire and solid wood flooring. \r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living Area:\r\nLarge open plan space with tiled flooring. Fully fitted kitchen with integrated electric hob, double oven, dishwasher and fridge. Tiled splashback and double doors leading to rear garden. Dining area with corner window and vaulted ceiling. \r\nUtility Room:\r\nFitted units, fridge/freezer, tiled flooring and door to side. \r\nBedroom 1: \r\nGenerous bedroom overlooking rear garden with carpet flooring and built-in Sliderobes. \r\nBedroom 2: \r\nFront aspect bedroom with carpet flooring and built-in Sliderobes. \r\nBedroom 3:\r\nRear aspect room with laminate flooring and built-in Sliderobes. \r\nBedroom 4: \r\nFront aspect room with carpet flooring.\r\nFamily Bathroom:\r\nWC, wash hand basin, bath with overhead electric shower. Heated towel rail and tiled flooring. \r\n\r\nSelf-contained Annex with independent access:\r\nEntrance Hallway: \r\nLaminate flooring. \r\nLiving Room:\r\nFront aspect room with laminate flooring and open fire. \r\nKitchen/Dining Area:\r\nFitted kitchen with electric cooker, fridge/freezer and washing machine. Tiled flooring, tiled splashback and sliding door leading to rear garden. \r\nBedroom 1:\r\nLaminate flooring and built-in wardrobes. \r\nShower Room:\r\nWC, wash hand basin and electric shower. Fully tiled. \r\nUpstairs:\r\nRoom 1:\r\nLarge space with timber flooring and Velux windows.\r\nRoom 2:\r\nTimber flooring and Velux window. \r\n\r\nNotable features:\r\nSubstantial, detached family home- approx. 254 sq. metres.\r\nSelf-contained annex attached to the property with independent access.\r\nAnnex suitable for multi-generational living or as a rental unit. \r\nConstructed in circa 1976. \r\nGenerous living accommodation with versatile rooms. \r\nIdeal family home with spacious rear garden. \r\nMature site extending to approximately 0.4 acres. \r\nGravelled driveway and lawned gardens to front & rear. \r\nBER: D.BER Number's: 119784601 & 119786069. \r\nEircode: P25 T027. \r\nOutline for illustration purposes only. \r\n\r\nServices:\r\nPrivate septic tank.\r\nMains water. \r\nOil fired central heating. \r\n\r\nIncluded in sale: \r\nBeing sold as is with all carpets, blinds, light fittings, furniture, and kitchen appliances as viewed included in the sale. \r\n \r\nFor more information please contact: \r\nKyle Kennedy, \r\nKennedy Estate Agents."
      },
